---
layout: base.njk
title: 术语与故事索引
permalink: /terms/
---
{% from "components.njk" import filterBar %}
<div class="container page-main"><nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="面包屑"><a href="{{ '/' | url }}">首页</a><span>/</span><span aria-current="page">索引</span></nav><header class="page-header"><p class="eyebrow">第二轴 · 术语反查</p><h1>术语与故事索引</h1><p class="lead">从白话释义出发，回到它出现的故事。筛选标签与难度，找到适合你的阅读入口。</p></header>{{ filterBar('', true, contentData.series, taxonomy.axes.tags.items, contentData.coverage.tags, contentData.coverage.levels, contentData.terms | length, 0) }}<div class="term-index" data-filter-list>{% for term in contentData.terms %}<article class="term-row" id="term-{{ term.name }}" data-story data-scene="{{ term.scenes | unique | join(',') }}" data-tags="{{ term.tags | unique | join(',') }}" data-difficulty="{{ term.levels | unique | join(',') }}" data-search="{{ term.name }} {{ term.definition }} {% for story in term.stories %}{{ story.title }} {% endfor %}"><div><h2>{{ term.name }}</h2><p>{{ term.definition }}</p></div><div class="term-links"><span class="small">出现在 {{ term.storySlugs | length }} 篇</span>{% for story in term.stories %}<a href="{{ ('/story/' + story.slug + '/') | url }}">{{ story.title }} ↗</a>{% endfor %}</div></article>{% endfor %}</div><div class="empty-state" data-empty hidden><h2>没有符合条件的术语</h2><p>试试缩短搜索词、切换场景、减少标签或重置难度。</p><button type="button" class="button" data-clear-filters>清除全部筛选</button></div><noscript><p>此静态预览的 URL 筛选需要 JavaScript；所有术语与故事链接仍可直接阅读。</p></noscript></div>
